WEBVTT

00:00:12.461 --> 00:00:14.797
[ALARM SCREECHING]

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.258
[MEN SHOUTING NEARBY]

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.470
MAN 1: They're here!
MAN 2: Search everywhere!

00:00:21.512 --> 00:00:22.763
MAN 1: Look down by the stables!
You two, come with me!

00:00:24.849 --> 00:00:26.350
MAN 3:
Any sign?

00:00:39.697 --> 00:00:41.824
[ALARM SCREECHING]

00:00:41.866 --> 00:00:42.908
MAN 4:
Potter!

00:00:56.172 --> 00:00:57.631
OLD MAN:
In here, Potter.

00:01:11.145 --> 00:01:13.230
Did you get a look at him?

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:16.192
-For a second, I thought it was....
HERMIONE: I know. Dumbledore.

00:01:16.233 --> 00:01:18.194
[MEN CHATTERING NEARBY]

00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:34.043
Harry?

00:01:36.045 --> 00:01:38.255
I can see you in this.

00:01:46.555 --> 00:01:48.474
[DOOR OPENS]

00:01:51.435 --> 00:01:54.104
You bloody fools.
What were you thinking coming here?

00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:56.565
Have you any idea how dangerous it is?

00:01:56.607 --> 00:02:00.277
You're Aberforth, Dumbledore's brother.

00:02:00.819 --> 00:02:02.613
It's you who I've been seeing in here.

00:02:03.447 --> 00:02:05.199
You're the one who sent Dobby.

00:02:05.241 --> 00:02:06.533
Where have you left him?

00:02:06.951 --> 00:02:08.285
He's dead.

00:02:08.869 --> 00:02:10.996
Sorry to hear it. I liked that elf.

00:02:11.038 --> 00:02:13.958
Who gave that to you? The mirror?

00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:16.919
Mundungus Fletcher, about a year ago.

00:02:16.961 --> 00:02:20.214
-Dung had no right. It belonged to--
ABERFORTH: Sirius.

00:02:20.714 --> 00:02:22.591
Albus told me.

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:27.513
He also told me you'd likely be hacked off
if you ever found out I had it...

00:02:27.554 --> 00:02:32.476
...but ask yourself,
where would you be if I didn't?

00:02:35.437 --> 00:02:38.274
Do you hear from the others much?
From the Order?

00:02:38.315 --> 00:02:40.401
The Order's finished.

00:02:40.442 --> 00:02:41.944
You-Know-Who's won.

00:02:41.986 --> 00:02:45.489
Anyone who says otherwise
is kidding themselves.

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:48.075
We need to get into Hogwarts, tonight.

00:02:48.492 --> 00:02:50.327
Dumbledore gave us a job to do.

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:52.162
Did he now?

00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:53.664
Nice job? Easy?

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.876
We've been hunting Horcruxes.

00:02:57.918 --> 00:03:01.463
We think the last one's inside the castle,
but we'll need help getting in.

00:03:01.505 --> 00:03:05.342
That's not a job my brother's given you.
It's a suicide mission.

00:03:05.384 --> 00:03:08.887
Do yourself a favor, boy, go home.
Live a little longer.

00:03:08.929 --> 00:03:13.600
-Dumbledore trusted me to see this through.
-What makes you think you can trust him?

00:03:14.018 --> 00:03:16.687
You think you can believe
anything my brother told you?

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:20.524
In all the time you knew him,
did he ever mention my name?

00:03:21.483 --> 00:03:23.736
Did he ever mention hers?

00:03:23.777 --> 00:03:27.489
-Why should he--?
-Keep secrets? You tell me.

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:32.119
-I trusted him.
-That's a boy's answer.

00:03:32.161 --> 00:03:35.372
A boy who goes chasing Horcruxes
on the word of a man...

00:03:35.414 --> 00:03:38.167
...who wouldn't even tell him where to start.
You're lying!

00:03:38.834 --> 00:03:42.755
Not just to me, that doesn't matter.
To yourself as well.

00:03:42.796 --> 00:03:44.965
That's what a fool does.

00:03:45.007 --> 00:03:49.011
You don't strike me as a fool,
Harry Potter.

00:03:49.053 --> 00:03:53.724
So I'll ask you again.
There must be a reason.

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:59.063
I'm not interested in what happened
between you and your brother.

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:02.066
I don't care that you've given up.

00:04:04.485 --> 00:04:07.112
I trusted the man I knew.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:13.327
And we need to get into
the castle tonight.

00:04:18.582 --> 00:04:21.001
You know what to do.

00:04:27.591 --> 00:04:29.551
HARRY:
Where have you sent her?

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:33.597
You'll see soon enough.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.564
That's your sister, Ariana, isn't it?

00:04:43.399 --> 00:04:46.276
She died very young, didn't she?

00:04:47.194 --> 00:04:51.073
My brother sacrificed many things,
Mr. Potter...

00:04:51.115 --> 00:04:53.742
...on his journey to find power...

00:04:53.784 --> 00:04:56.036
...including Ariana.

00:04:56.453 --> 00:04:59.331
And she was devoted to him.

00:04:59.957 --> 00:05:02.376
He gave her everything...

00:05:03.335 --> 00:05:05.087
...but time.

00:05:06.463 --> 00:05:08.841
HERMIONE:
Thank you, Mr. Dumbledore.

00:05:11.635 --> 00:05:13.679
[DOOR CLOSES]

00:05:15.681 --> 00:05:18.225
He did save our lives twice.

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:21.019
Kept an eye on us in that mirror.

00:05:22.271 --> 00:05:25.315
[WHISPERS] That doesn't seem
like someone who's given up.

00:05:30.487 --> 00:05:32.614
She's coming back.

00:05:33.365 --> 00:05:34.533
RON:
Who's that with her?

00:05:42.749 --> 00:05:43.959
Neville.

00:05:44.001 --> 00:05:46.628
-Oh, you look--
-Like hell, I reckon.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.298
This is nothing. Seamus is worse.

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:53.510
Hey, Ab, we've got a couple more
coming through.

00:05:54.678 --> 00:05:56.680
RON: Don't remember this
on the Marauder's Map.

00:05:56.722 --> 00:05:58.765
That's because it never existed till now.

00:05:58.807 --> 00:06:02.186
The seven secret passages were sealed off
before the start of the year.

00:06:02.227 --> 00:06:04.146
This is the only way in or out now.

00:06:04.188 --> 00:06:06.940
The grounds are crawling with
Death Eaters and Dementors.

00:06:06.982 --> 00:06:08.817
HERMIONE:
How bad is Snape as headmaster?

00:06:08.859 --> 00:06:11.945
Hardly ever see him.
It's the Carrows you need to watch out for.

00:06:11.987 --> 00:06:13.155
Carrows?

00:06:13.197 --> 00:06:15.782
Yeah. Brother and sister.
In charge of discipline.

00:06:15.824 --> 00:06:17.659
They like punishment, the Carrows.

00:06:17.701 --> 00:06:19.828
HERMIONE:
They did that to you? Why?

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:23.665
NEVILLE: Today's Dark Arts lessons
had us practicing the Cruciatus Curse.

00:06:23.707 --> 00:06:25.751
On first-years.

00:06:25.792 --> 00:06:27.628
I refused.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.547
Hogwarts has changed.

00:06:43.435 --> 00:06:45.896
Let's have a bit of fun, shall we?

00:06:51.026 --> 00:06:54.071
Hey, listen up, you lot.
Brought you a surprise.

00:06:54.112 --> 00:06:58.242
Not more of Aberforth's cooking, I hope.
Be a surprise if we can digest it.

00:07:01.078 --> 00:07:02.287
Blimey.

00:07:02.329 --> 00:07:04.665
-Harry!
-Yeah!

